<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="am">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>የኢየሱስ ልጆች Apostolic Media</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #f5f7fb;
      color: #172033;
    }

    header {
      background: #101d3a;
      color: white;
      padding: 25px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    header p {
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    .hero {
      margin: 20px;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: #d9b44a;
      color: #101d3a;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .container {
      padding: 0 20px 90px;
    }

    .section-title {
      margin: 25px 0 12px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 20px 12px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }

    .icon {
      font-size: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .ad {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px dashed #aaa;
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: white;
      color: #777;
    }

    nav {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      background: white;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-around;
      padding: 12px 5px;
      box-shadow: 0 -3px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    nav div {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    nav span {
      display: block;
      font-size: 21px;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>✝️ የኢየሱስ ልጆች</h1>
  <p>Apostolic Media</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

  <div class="hero">
    <h2>ወደ አፕሊኬሽናችን እንኳን በደህና መጡ</h2>
    <p>የመጽሐፍ ቅዱስ ትምህርቶች፣ መዝሙሮች፣ መጻሕፍት እና ቪዲዮዎች።</p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">ዋና ክፍሎች</h2>

  <div class="cards">

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">📖</div>
      <h3>Bible Teaching</h3>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🎵</div>
      <h3>Songs</h3>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">📚</div>
      <h3>Library</h3>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🎥</div>
      <h3>Videos</h3>
    </div>

  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">Premium</h2>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">⭐</div>
    <h3>Premium Content</h3>
    <p>ልዩ የጥናት እና የመማሪያ ይዘቶች</p>
  </div>

  <div class="ad">
    📢 Advertisement Area
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">ድጋፍ ያድርጉ</h2>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">❤️</div>
    <h3>Support the Ministry</h3>
    <p>የሚዲያ አገልግሎቱን ለመደገፍ</p>
  </div>

</div>

<nav>
  <div><span>🏠</span>Home</div>
  <div><span>📖</span>Teaching</div>
  <div><span>🎵</span>Songs</div>
  <div><span>📚</span>Library</div>
  <div><span>👤</span>Account</div>
</nav>

</body>
</html>
